cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this exploratory software and report; do not describe it as a decipherment."
title: "Beyond the Signs: an open research notebook on the Voynich manuscript and the Codex Seraphinianus"
abstract: "Reproducible statistical experiments on the Voynich manuscript, with the Codex Seraphinianus, Latin and Italian as comparison corpora: matched context models, word-structure tests, calibrated PCFG versus HMM comparisons, a simple-substitution attack with positive controls, and a public register of hypotheses and failed calibrations."
